_handoff/rw-v2/legs/v12-attempt1-REJECTED.mdx:107:It was mid-late 2025 when I started building <Term id="skillmeat">SkillMeat</Term>, my registry and deployment tool for reusable agent capabilities. Getting useful behavior once was no longer the hard part. Making that behavior repeatable across projects, machines, teams, and runtimes was. Good agent behavior is a bundle: instructions, context, assumptions, examples, tools, permissions, and review expectations.
